  - m_Id: 73184814604967941
    m_Localized: Combo Attack Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967942
    m_Localized: Consecutive hits raise attack power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967943
    m_Localized: Every 10 hits, attack power increases by 10% for 5 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967944
    m_Localized: Low HP Attack Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967945
    m_Localized: Attack power rises when HP is low
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967946
    m_Localized: While HP is below 30%, attack power increases by 50%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967947
    m_Localized: Multitasking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967948
    m_Localized: Hitting different enemies raises your rate of fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967949
    m_Localized: Each hit on a different enemy than the last raises your rate of
      fire (up to a limit). Hitting the same enemy repeatedly resets it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967950
    m_Localized: Excessive Intimidation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967951
    m_Localized: The bullet gets bigger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967952
    m_Localized: Bullet size increases by {value1}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967953
    m_Localized: Bullseye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814604967954
    m_Localized: Damage rises the more enemies a bullet pierces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356544
    m_Localized: Each time a single bullet pierces a set number of enemies, its damage
      to the following enemies increases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356545
    m_Localized: Rage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356546
    m_Localized: Taking damage raises attack power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356547
    m_Localized: When hit, attack power increases by 20% for a duration based on
      the damage taken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356548
    m_Localized: Barrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356549
    m_Localized: Gain a barrier that blocks damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356550
    m_Localized: Gain a barrier equal to {value1}% of maximum HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356551
    m_Localized: Normal Shot Damage Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356552
    m_Localized: Normal shot damage increases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356553
