    m_Localized: Merge shot damage increases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356559
    m_Localized: Merge shot damage increases by {value1}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356560
    m_Localized: Choke Point
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356561
    m_Localized: Enemies tend to spawn close together
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356562
    m_Localized: There is a {value1}% chance that an enemy spawns near the previously
      spawned enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356563
    m_Localized: Big Mouth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356564
    m_Localized: Rush enemies appear more often
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356565
    m_Localized: There is a {value1}% chance that a rush enemy appears in place of
      a minor enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356566
    m_Localized: Diversion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356567
    m_Localized: Enemies tend to spawn from where you have been defeating them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356568
    m_Localized: After defeating several enemies, there is a {value1}% chance that
      the next enemy spawns from that direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356569
    m_Localized: Giant Killing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356570
    m_Localized: Defeating enemies restores HP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356571
    m_Localized: Defeating a minor enemy restores {value1} HP, and defeating a major
      enemy restores {value2} HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356572
    m_Localized: Dopamine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356573
    m_Localized: Switching forms between kills raises your rate of fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356574
    m_Localized: Defeating an enemy with a different form than the last raises your
      rate of fire, and more so if it differs from the last two. Defeating with the
      same form resets it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356575
    m_Localized: Adrenaline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356576
    m_Localized: The lower your HP, the less damage you take
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356577
    m_Localized: Damage taken is reduced in proportion to the HP you have lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356578
    m_Localized: Peacemaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356579
    m_Localized: Normal shots fire faster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356580
    m_Localized: Normal shot cooldown becomes {value2}x. However, after {value1}
      consecutive normal shots, the next shot's cooldown becomes {value3}x.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356581
    m_Localized: Avalanche
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356582
    m_Localized: Keep landing merge shots to fire them faster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356583
    m_Localized: Merge shot cooldown becomes {value1}x. However, if the previous
      merge shot hit, the next one becomes {value2}x.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356584
    m_Localized: Lucky Chance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356585
    m_Localized: Attacks can land critical hits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356586
    m_Localized: Attacks have a {value1}% chance to be critical hits (+100% damage).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356587
    m_Localized: Killing Call
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356588
    m_Localized: Higher critical chance against your focus target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356589
    m_Localized: When a focus shot first hits the focus target, it has a {value1}%
      chance to be a critical hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356590
    m_Localized: Turntable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356591
    m_Localized: The lower your HP, the higher your critical chance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356592
    m_Localized: Critical chance increases with the HP you have lost (up to {value1}%
      near 0 HP).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356593
    m_Localized: Snake Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356594
    m_Localized: Enemies you look at slow down
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356595
    m_Localized: Enemies at the center of your view (within {value2}m) move at {value1}x
      speed. The effect lasts {value3} seconds after you look away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356596
    m_Localized: Medusa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356597
    m_Localized: Strong enemies you look at are stunned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356598
    m_Localized: Major, boss and irregular enemies at the center of your view (within
      {value2}m) are stunned for {value1} seconds (once per enemy).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356599
    m_Localized: Mean Mug
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356600
    m_Localized: Deal more damage to enemies you look at
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356601
    m_Localized: Damage dealt to enemies at the center of your view (within {value2}m)
      becomes {value1}x.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356602
    m_Localized: "Dependency Node \u03B1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356603
    m_Localized: Strengthens other nodes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356604
    m_Localized: Has no effect on its own. The more kinds of dependency nodes you
      hold, the stronger your other nodes become.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356605
    m_Localized: "Dependency Node \u03B2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356606
    m_Localized: Strengthens other nodes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356607
    m_Localized: Has no effect on its own. The more kinds of dependency nodes you
      hold, the stronger your other nodes become.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356608
    m_Localized: "Dependency Node \u03B3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356609
    m_Localized: Strengthens other nodes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356610
    m_Localized: Has no effect on its own. The more kinds of dependency nodes you
      hold, the stronger your other nodes become.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356611
    m_Localized: Damage Node
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356612
    m_Localized: Attack power rises with each dependency node
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356613
    m_Localized: Attack power increases by {value1}% per active dependency node type.
      With no dependency nodes, attack power becomes {value2}x.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356614
    m_Localized: Care Node
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356615
    m_Localized: Continuously restores HP for each dependency node
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356616
    m_Localized: Restores {value1}% of maximum HP per second per active dependency
      node type. With no dependency nodes, you take {value2}% of maximum HP (at least
      {value3}) as damage per second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356617
    m_Localized: Emergency Node
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356618
    m_Localized: Sacrifice a dependency node to survive a fatal blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356619
    m_Localized: When you would take fatal damage, one dependency node is disabled
      to negate it, and HP is restored to {value1}% of maximum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356620
    m_Localized: Counter Step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356621
    m_Localized: Attack power rises right after dodging
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73184814613356622
    m_Localized: For a few seconds after dodging, attack power increases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
